{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2011-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1303516800, "end_date": 1304207999, "month_true_total": 87, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:52:27 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "563502", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972261419", "personaname": "corpse", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/corpse25/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 1390, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1390, "last_played": 1318748400, "avatar": "a5f5411b78d5e42bb7651ad5105786f93253d199"}, "language": "english", "review": "This title is pretty close to NeoContra from Konami on the Playstation 2 Platform. This is a very hard unforgiving over the top shooter and requires a butt load of team work. If you enjoy challenging shooters this is for you!", "timestamp_created": 1304155097, "timestamp_updated": 1304155097, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "2065160", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001715819", "personaname": "Dex", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/triggadex/", "num_games_owned": 336, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 732, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 732, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "6a405da0faa48391c8fa0aae30c81223ad003645"}, "language": "english", "review": "Everyone should get this, its a good Co-op game and its Free, nuff said.", "timestamp_created": 1304142088, "timestamp_updated": 1304142088, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4081057", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031743877", "personaname": "Jask110", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031743877/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 125, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "7fec491032f41bf9f206444328a518cfb4905d5f"}, "language": "english", "review": "this is a great game if you like over-head shooters.", "timestamp_created": 1304087814, "timestamp_updated": 1304087814, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3564670", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024790864", "personaname": "Nane", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Nanewa/", "num_games_owned": 363, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1068, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 953, "last_played": 1422893733, "avatar": "890f04e00a1a264433c01ec9acc0e0311094aa71"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best Game :D", "timestamp_created": 1304016873, "timestamp_updated": 1304016873, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "3822309", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027837817", "personaname": "Epirasque", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027837817/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 18290, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16011, "last_played": 1492808917, "avatar": "10181b5c937e158004d0386524c260b8db31fbad"}, "language": "english", "review": "Free to play, yet an awesome amount of coop-fun. Absolutely no pay to win, there is actually nothing you can buy at all. \nIt has several elements from the Alien movies, especially the second one, but there is not much horror in this. \nHaving 5 difficulty settings, all combineable with unpredictable \"onslaught\" and \"hardcore friendly fire\" settings makes this game very approachable but also challenging. \nUnlike games like L4D2, you cannot revive each other. The missions are mostly rather short though. \nYou gain levelups which unlocks new equipment to chose from (not always better stuff: the game highly relies on your personal skill and teamplay). \nThe top-down view takes some time to get used to, but it helps to prevent chaos and encourages teamplay simply because you have more overview (think of League of Legends or Dota, you would not want to play those in 1st person). \nThe only real downside I see is that there is only 1 native campaign (7 maps I think) and you cannot download new maps ingame. There is, however, a free mappack (1.2 gb content as of this writing) which is installed simply by copying all files into a specific folder. \n\nOverall: 9/10.", "timestamp_created": 1303924517, "timestamp_updated": 1410861274, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}